<title>UK: IBCA rates L-Bank's $250 mln notes.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-Bank's $250 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg (L-Bank) $250 milion 6.5 percent notes due 2000.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
